            "notes": "On round 2 unless you want to counter a specific character/s the safe pick is [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or if you'd like [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) (I usually get this later or next round even since ult charge will be easier to get as our DMG will be much higher)\n\nOptionally if the team has alot of shields eg. Rein, Brig, Zen and it's annoying you can pick [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or if there's a Pharmercy or an annoying Freya you can pick [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204)\n\nIf you can't afford an epic I would sell [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34)",
