        {
            "id": "c03f0ae0-ec0b-4101-a46f-e3cb0a423b21",
            "build_id": "a2851578-df5a-4b60-95c3-2f63b840af09",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:39:47.511927+00:00",
            "notes": "This round we sell [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) if you haven't already and purchase [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), this will give you a huge DMG boost.\n\nIf you don't have enough you can keep [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) (or sell if needed) and buy [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) which is good in general but also amazing for fan the hammer kills after flashbangs or you can buy [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)\n\n**OR**\n\nBuy the appropriate items to counter their team that I mentioned last round eg. flying, shields, etc.\nThe only counter that is **not** worth it in my opinion is [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) for Zarya. Just don't bother, easy flashbang and fan the hammer up close when her bubbles are on cooldown and her head is really easy to hit in general.\n\nFor abilities we buy [Barrel Roll](item_c5368723-a7c9-4124-9bc1-7749917b0c8a) so we have a much easier time rolling away from enemies diving you when you're trying to get a pick, or you can even finish a kill with it if you get the opportunity. (you can also knock people off the objective, it's helpful if a Mei is about to try stall on point last second.)",
