            "created_at": "2025-09-09T08:39:47.511927+00:00",
            "notes": "I would usually buy [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) this round or last round as you'll be dealing much more DMG making it easier to build ult charge early fast.\n\nIf you can't afford it or any optional's that you'd like, sell either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) or both.\n\nYour aim at this point is to play around corners, high ground and off angles, sometimes even taking people by surprise by flicking around corners or flashbang and fan the hammer to delete them, especially if you bought [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448).\n\nIf it doesn't work you have your extended roll to get away. (this doesn't mean always be away from your team, just look for off angles every now and again to get shots either a bit behind the enemy team for the supports or into the action. Once there's a pick or two join your team and finish off the fight quickly. Also again, the 3rd person camera makes it alot easier to play around corners)",
