            "notes": "From here onwards you get the idea of it, just buy whatever deals the highest DMG.\n\nAgain if you can't afford something sell whatever non epic items you have to get it, if you still don't have enough get whatever rare's give you the most weapon power.\n\nFor ability we get [Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) so we can roll more often or if you'd like you can get [Think Flasht](item_3bce3ff6-cbf3-4515-b5cb-648f536a1d37) so when you get chased or someone dives you it slows them down, this one is good against reaper, **ESPECIALLY** when they have the Ability to do a mini-death blossom after a teleport. At that point you have a choice of rolling away or flashbanging them and fanning the hammer, from my experience most of the time you kill them first.",
